# Settings > Updates P2 (report 047): installing 0.8.13 from a release build 0.8.12 (arm64), up to the password. The
# Launcher level offers "Install 0.8.13" with the bundle's size; Install checks the guards and downloads as the user
# (the fake curl first holds at 0 %, then at 35 %: "Downloading  19 of 55 MB", "Stop the download", the progress bar
# under the status line at 0 % then 35 %); once the download is checked
# (sha256 against the .sha256 asset and GitHub's digest) the question opens by itself: downloaded and checked, the
# launcher restarts and closes open apps, what is kept, the old version back by itself, and on a board without a battery
# "Keep the board plugged in" (D16). Install opens the shared sudo prompt (the band in PDA mode); Esc cancels it: the
# status line says so and nothing ran; the checked bundle stays ("Install 0.8.13  downloaded": Install asks again).
# Review only: no golden.
title updates install
review
sizes 640x480 480x800 480x640 720x720 1280x800
@480x800,480x640 profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env HARNESS_SUDO prompt
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30 2026-11-04
wifi 70
bt on
update net on
update build 0.8.12 release arm64
update answer releases-0.8.13.json
update download pending
home
launch Settings
wait 300
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 1000
key ENTER
wait 300
shot updates_install_row
header updates_install_row "Settings > Updates > Launcher" "Updates > Launcher" Launcher
expect_text "Install 0.8.13"
expect_text "55 MB"
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 500
shot updates_downloading_start
expect_text "Downloading"
expect_text "0 of 55 MB"
update download 35
wait 500
shot updates_downloading
expect_text "Downloading"
expect_text "19 of 55 MB"
expect_text "Stop the download"
update download done
wait 1000
shot updates_confirm
expect_text "Install 0.8.13?"
key ENTER
wait 600
shot updates_sudo
key ESC
wait 400
shot updates_install_cancelled
expect_text "Cancelled"
expect_text "Install 0.8.13"
expect_text "downloaded"
